// Kassahi bucket map names / tiers / frames (issue #981). Phil777 keeps the previous version in
// 05-Kassahi_maps-2[Kassahi,ONLY=Phil777]. Unique maps stop at %UNI_MAPS%; the other maps keep
// the immunity and corruption tags and end on %COW_MAP% (Blood Moon) / %NORMAL_MAPS%.
// DUEL ARENAS (INFO)
ItemDisplay[NMAG MAPTIER=0]: %NAME%{%WHITE%Without Result in Perma Death%NL%%RED%HC %WHITE%Can PVP in Duel Arenas}%CONTINUE%
